Why the Return Value Is So Clever

This is the key to understanding the solution.

The recursive function isn't simply returning:

“Is p here?”

It returns:

“What useful node did I find in this subtree?”

That useful node can be:

null
p
q
LCA

This is a very powerful tree recursion pattern.

